[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1320.31, "timestamp": "00:22:00", "text": "触れると、彼らは手に入れるでしょう。うん。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1322.31, "timestamp": "00:22:02", "text": "彼らは何が起こっているのか不思議に思うだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1325.19, "timestamp": "00:22:05", "text": "などなど。だから私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1327.27, "timestamp": "00:22:07", "text": "朝とか色々。少し痛い"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1329.149, "timestamp": "00:22:09", "text": "私も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1338.07, "timestamp": "00:22:18", "text": "午前中とかに。いいえ、だって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1339.789, "timestamp": "00:22:19", "text": "人々は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1343.31, "timestamp": "00:22:23", "text": "弁護士と協力して"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1345.549, "timestamp": "00:22:25", "text": "など"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1348.63, "timestamp": "00:22:28", "text": "弁護士がなぜ多くの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1351.149, "timestamp": "00:22:31", "text": "本とか、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1351.856, "timestamp": "00:22:31", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "don't they go to court? or is it their chamber?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1362.149, "timestamp": "00:22:42", "text": "非常識な。あの部屋ですか？それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1363.549, "timestamp": "00:22:43", "text": "部屋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1366.47, "timestamp": "00:22:46", "text": "うん。ええと、裁判所。私は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1367.99, "timestamp": "00:22:47", "text": "弁護士は、弁護士の中には"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1370.95, "timestamp": "00:22:50", "text": "ここで他のことをしながら過ごしています。彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1373.75, "timestamp": "00:22:53", "text": "まだ動いている。いいえ、半分くらいは終わりました。の"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1379.866, "timestamp": "00:22:59", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-r